cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the slimmc family, please cite the software and the component versions used."
title: "slimmc: stochastic kinetic Monte Carlo simulation and analysis for polymerization"
type: software
version: "5.0.3"
abstract: >-
  Independent Nim implementation developed from an original pre-generative-AI
  homopolymer/PLP simulator by Szczepan Bednarz. Subsequent development,
  testing and documentation were assisted by OpenAI ChatGPT and Anthropic
  Claude under human direction and review. AI systems are tools, not authors
  or copyright holders.
authors:
  - family-names: Bednarz
    given-names: Szczepan
